    EVENT_INFO, TEAM_SIZE, RULES, PREPARATION, CAREERS, MATERIALS, SUBMISSIONS, COST,
    DIFFICULTY, THEME, EVENT_RECOMMENDATION, EVENT_COMPARISON, GENERAL_HELP, AI_USAGE,
    DRESS_CODE, DEADLINES, NATIONAL_CONFERENCE, STATE_CONFERENCE, SOURCE_REQUEST,
